# purpose: every M1 rule at least once, with the input format stretched a little.
# exercises: all three currencies; blank lines and comments in the middle of the file;
#            the amount forms 1 / 1.5 / 1.50 / 0.01; unknown-account before any OPEN;
#            a rejection between two accepted commands must not leave a gap in <seq>.

DEPOSIT nobody 10
BALANCE nobody

OPEN acc-usd USD
OPEN acc-eur EUR
OPEN acc-gbp GBP

# amounts in every accepted shape
DEPOSIT acc-usd 1
DEPOSIT acc-usd 1.5
DEPOSIT acc-usd 1.50
DEPOSIT acc-usd 0.01
BALANCE acc-usd

# a large amount, no thousands separators on the way out
DEPOSIT acc-eur 1234567.89
BALANCE acc-eur

# re-opening under any currency is account-exists
OPEN acc-usd USD
OPEN acc-usd EUR
OPEN acc-gbp GBP

# interleaved, with rejections in between
DEPOSIT acc-gbp 5
DEPOSIT acc-xyz 5
DEPOSIT acc-eur 0.11
DEPOSIT acc-gbp 5
BALANCE acc-xyz
DEPOSIT acc-usd 96.49

# ids at the edges of the grammar: 32 chars, digits only, a lone dash
OPEN a2345678901234567890123456789012 USD
OPEN 42 EUR
OPEN - GBP
DEPOSIT 42 0.5
DEPOSIT - 0.5

BALANCE acc-usd
BALANCE acc-eur
BALANCE acc-gbp
BALANCE a2345678901234567890123456789012
BALANCE 42
BALANCE -
